# VisualForge AI Studio: this repository holds ONLY source, scripts, tests and
# documentation. Everything the studio downloads or produces stays out of Git:
#   Runtime/   (ComfyUI, Python runtimes, Ollama: ~16 GB)   -> fetched by Setup
#   Models/    (all neural-network weights: ~160 GB)        -> fetched by Setup
#   UserData/  (settings, chats, prompts, results, logs)    -> private, never published
# Anything not listed in the allow-list below is ignored, so a new folder or
# file is never pushed by accident. Add new source folders explicitly.

# --- 1. Ignore everything at the repository root ...
/*

# --- 2. ... except the allow-listed source items
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/README.ru.md
!/LICENSE
!/LICENSE.md
!/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!/Setup-VisualForge.cmd
!/Start-VisualForge.cmd
!/App/
!/docs/
!/tests/
!/tools/
!/Support/
!/.githooks/
!/.github/

# Support/ holds installer-time diagnostics and recovery material; only the
# license texts are source.
/Support/*
!/Support/Licenses/

# Local screenshot-reading benchmark (corpus, scripts, run results, logs): kept on this machine for future retests, never published.
/tools/ocr_bench/

# --- 3. Never inside allow-listed folders, whatever their name
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log
*.tmp
*.part
*.partial
*.bak
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Heavy binary payloads (models, runtimes, archives, media). The installer
# downloads these from their original sources.
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.gguf
*.bin
*.onnx
*.npz
*.7z
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.whl
*.dll
*.pyd
*.so
*.exe
*.msi
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3

# Generated/private material is forbidden even inside an allowed source folder.
**/Models/
**/Runtime/
**/UserData/
**/BrowserProfiles/
**/Cache/
**/cache/
**/caches/
**/Results/
**/results/
**/outputs/
**/logs/
**/temp/
**/tmp/
**/backups/
**/downloads/
**/node_modules/
**/.cache/
**/.venv/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/prompts/
**/chats/
**/history/
**/sessions/
**/generated/
**/reports/
*.sqlite*
*.db
*.jsonl
*.ndjson
*.crdownload
*.dmp
*.safetensors.*
*.gguf.*
*.sft
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.tflite
*.ot
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.ggml
*.pb
*.tensor
*.npy
*.rar
*.xz
*.bz2
*.zst
*.safetensors.index.json
*.gif
*.webp
*.jpeg
*.jpg
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.aac
*.avi
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pptx
*.psd
*.blend
*.png
*.ico
!/App/frontend/visualforge-icon.png
!/App/frontend/visualforge-icon.ico
prompts.json
favorites.json
chats.json
*prompt*archive*.json
*prompt*history*.json
*job*history*.json
*.settings.json
*token*.txt
*credentials*.json

# Only explicitly reviewed publication workflows belong here.
/.github/*
!/.github/workflows/
/.github/workflows/*
!/.github/workflows/source-guard.yml
